1
00:00:01,130 --> 00:00:02,670
♪

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,760
[COMMANDER]
Pick up the pace, men!

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:07,880
[BRIGADE] Yes, sir!

4
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,050
[COMMANDER] Hurry,
before someone else

5
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:12,350
beats us to it!

6
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:13,720
[BRIGADE] Yes, sir!

7
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:16,930
We've got a big payday
on the line for this job,

8
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:19,020
-so be prepared to... Uh?
-[explosion]

9
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:21,360
[COMMANDER] Huh?

10
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:26,150
[indistinct shouting]

11
00:00:26,570 --> 00:00:29,110
-[ADVENTURER 1] Up there!
-[ADVENTURER 2] Make 'em bleed!

12
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:34,790
[scoffs]
We caused some solid chaos.

13
00:00:35,330 --> 00:00:36,330
[IRI] Mm.

14
00:00:36,370 --> 00:00:38,210
[LIDEO] It's unbelievable.

15
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:41,500
I never thought they'd take
such aggressive measures.

16
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,920
Big Brother,

17
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:47,260
perhaps we should retreat
through the underground passage.

18
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:48,420
[LIDEO] No.

19
00:00:48,670 --> 00:00:51,180
The turmoil in the city
will hide us well enough.

20
00:00:51,590 --> 00:00:54,050
Have you called in
all available forces?

21
00:00:54,430 --> 00:00:56,430
It's already being seen to.

22
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:58,060
Speaking of,

23
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:00,980
Shiji Bau says
she hired the Iron Whale.

24
00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:02,560
[LIDEO] Is that a fact?

25
00:01:03,270 --> 00:01:06,030
Our backup may not arrive
in time, though.

26
00:01:06,070 --> 00:01:08,400
We'll have to deploy
every adventurer we have

27
00:01:08,440 --> 00:01:09,740
for this battle.

28
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:12,910
One last matter of business.

29
00:01:12,950 --> 00:01:14,370
It seems we'll have to kill

30
00:01:14,410 --> 00:01:16,450
the man pacted
with the goddess.

31
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:20,210
Iri, be sure to stay
right by my side.

32
00:01:20,250 --> 00:01:22,250
Yes, I will.

33
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:24,750
I would gladly give my life
to protect you.

34
00:01:24,790 --> 00:01:26,170
I'm grateful.

35
00:01:26,340 --> 00:01:29,760
A family that's willing to kill
or die for one another...

36
00:01:30,090 --> 00:01:31,380
As it should be,

37
00:01:31,430 --> 00:01:33,340
in a perfect world.

38
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:38,350
[♪ opening theme song playing]

39
00:03:07,060 --> 00:03:09,560
[KIVIA] I bet that bastard Xylo
planned for things

40
00:03:09,610 --> 00:03:11,150
to go the violent route
from the start.

41
00:03:11,190 --> 00:03:14,190
We can only hope
this is all going to plan.

42
00:03:14,530 --> 00:03:15,820
Well, if so,

43
00:03:15,860 --> 00:03:19,030
he's more reckless
than I imagined.

44
00:03:19,070 --> 00:03:20,280
Here we go!

45
00:03:20,330 --> 00:03:24,000
Kill every last one of 'em!
[grunts]

46
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,210
[screams]

47
00:03:30,250 --> 00:03:31,590
You're pathetic.

48
00:03:31,630 --> 00:03:33,630
All right! Who's next in line?

49
00:03:34,210 --> 00:03:36,510
An adequate performance at best.

50
00:03:36,550 --> 00:03:38,180
[MERCHANT] What are they doing?

51
00:03:38,220 --> 00:03:41,680
No way I'm gonna stay open
during a street fight! [gasps]

52
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:43,810
[Xylo grunts]

53
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:48,520
[XYLO] I don't think so.

54
00:03:51,070 --> 00:03:52,070
[grunts]

55
00:03:52,110 --> 00:03:53,230
Take that!

56
00:03:54,820 --> 00:03:55,860
[both gasp]

57
00:03:55,900 --> 00:03:57,450
[MAN 1]
Let's get outta here!

58
00:04:00,570 --> 00:04:02,160
[men panting]

59
00:04:04,830 --> 00:04:07,660
[MERCHANT] Oh, my shop
is completely wrecked.

60
00:04:07,710 --> 00:04:08,710
[man screams]

61
00:04:08,750 --> 00:04:10,750
Xylo, try to show
some restraint!

62
00:04:10,790 --> 00:04:12,960
[XYLO] I'm blocking the way
for reinforcements!

63
00:04:14,550 --> 00:04:15,590
[Kivia gasps]

64
00:04:15,630 --> 00:04:16,840
[boy grunting]

65
00:04:17,510 --> 00:04:18,880
[KIVIA] A child?

66
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:21,970
What do I do now?

67
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:25,220
There are so many!
Damn it all!

68
00:04:26,810 --> 00:04:28,230
[FRENCI]
There's no need to fear them.

69
00:04:28,270 --> 00:04:30,850
Simply watch out for their
lower angle of attack.

70
00:04:30,900 --> 00:04:32,730
[KIVIA] But they're kids.

71
00:04:33,730 --> 00:04:34,780
[FRENCI] Too slow.

72
00:04:38,490 --> 00:04:39,740
[boy groans]

73
00:04:42,070 --> 00:04:44,160
Ah, Gwemel's violet lightning.

74
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:45,240
Did my seal use

75
00:04:45,580 --> 00:04:48,000
demonstrate how to properly
fight them, Holy Knight?

76
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:50,540
Xylo, care to reveal your plan?

77
00:04:50,580 --> 00:04:53,290
I'm daring to hope there's more
than a smattering of rocks

78
00:04:53,330 --> 00:04:56,300
and berries in that
tiny skull of yours.

79
00:04:56,340 --> 00:04:58,380
Raise as much hell as possible.

80
00:04:58,420 --> 00:05:00,380
Lideo Sodrick
will have no choice

81
00:05:00,430 --> 00:05:01,930
but to pay attention to us.

82
00:05:03,340 --> 00:05:05,390
[FRENCI] My prior comment
was a discredit

83
00:05:05,430 --> 00:05:06,770
to rocks and berries.

84
00:05:06,810 --> 00:05:08,770
I've never heard
such a sloppy plan--

85
00:05:08,810 --> 00:05:10,690
[COMMANDER] Your fun's over!

86
00:05:11,270 --> 00:05:12,440
[scoffs]

87
00:05:13,770 --> 00:05:16,070
Would you be those
pesky troublemakers

88
00:05:16,110 --> 00:05:18,940
wreaking havoc in our city?
[scoffs]

89
00:05:19,570 --> 00:05:21,570
Time to get what you deserve!

90
00:05:21,610 --> 00:05:22,570
[laughter]

91
00:05:22,610 --> 00:05:24,660
Is this supposed to be a joke?

92
00:05:24,700 --> 00:05:26,200
They're entrusting
these ruffians

93
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,700
with protecting the peace?

94
00:05:27,740 --> 00:05:29,000
Sure looks like it.

95
00:05:29,290 --> 00:05:32,330
[scoffs] You have no clue
who you're dealing with, do you?

96
00:05:32,370 --> 00:05:35,710
The top party at the
Ioff City Adventurers Guild!

97
00:05:35,750 --> 00:05:37,460
Stained with blood
and accolades,

98
00:05:37,500 --> 00:05:39,920
we're the famous
Giant-Hunter Brigade!

99
00:05:39,970 --> 00:05:41,340
If you say so.

100
00:05:41,380 --> 00:05:42,720
[commander snarls]

101
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:43,890
At the ready!

102
00:05:43,930 --> 00:05:45,640
Don't show a lick of mercy!

103
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,760
Lightning staves?

104
00:05:46,810 --> 00:05:48,810
Now fire!

105
00:05:49,220 --> 00:05:50,560
[gasping]

106
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:53,850
Why don't you lunatics
watch where you're aiming?

107
00:05:54,190 --> 00:05:55,730
Who are these clowns?

108
00:05:55,770 --> 00:05:57,980
They're an embarrassment
and a farce.

109
00:05:58,030 --> 00:06:01,150
[commander laughs]
Fire at will!

110
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:03,360
Every shot landed
gets a big reward!

111
00:06:03,990 --> 00:06:05,820
No firepower, no accuracy.

112
00:06:05,870 --> 00:06:08,450
They're using fireworks
as battle staves.

113
00:06:11,210 --> 00:06:12,250
You've got this handled!

114
00:06:12,290 --> 00:06:13,920
Come back!
Don't you dare leave us

115
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:15,210
with these annoying jokesters!

116
00:06:18,090 --> 00:06:20,260
-[Xylo gasps]
-[laughs]

117
00:06:20,710 --> 00:06:22,840
Hope you're ready! [laughs]

118
00:06:23,010 --> 00:06:24,260
[Xylo grunts]

119
00:06:27,350 --> 00:06:28,350
[gasps]

120
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:32,230
[all grunting]

121
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,810
[screams, grunts]

122
00:06:42,940 --> 00:06:44,320
[ADVENTURER] We surrender.

123
00:06:47,200 --> 00:06:49,740
Any threat against
Xylo or myself

124
00:06:49,780 --> 00:06:52,580
is a declaration of war
on the Mastibolt family.

125
00:06:52,620 --> 00:06:54,120
You will come to regret it.

126
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:56,210
If you have any regard
for this city,

127
00:06:56,250 --> 00:06:59,340
stop fooling around
and take your jobs seriously!

128
00:06:59,630 --> 00:07:02,840
I was wrong about those two
not getting along. Uh?

129
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:04,340
[troll growls]

130
00:07:08,180 --> 00:07:10,470
[troll roars]

131
00:07:10,510 --> 00:07:11,680
A troll?

132
00:07:11,810 --> 00:07:14,640
Sodrick actually has
a faerie under his command?

133
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:16,400
How unfortunate.

134
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:19,360
I despise dealing
with undisciplined pets.

135
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:20,440
[footsteps thudding]

136
00:07:22,730 --> 00:07:24,030
[roars]

137
00:07:27,780 --> 00:07:29,280
[troll growls]

138
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:32,830
[Xylo grunts]

139
00:07:33,450 --> 00:07:35,080
[troll growls]

140
00:07:35,410 --> 00:07:37,040
[commander laughs]

141
00:07:37,080 --> 00:07:39,040
Looks like the tables
have turned.

142
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:41,040
Let's put 'em
out of their misery!

143
00:07:41,090 --> 00:07:43,000
You heard him! Attack!

144
00:07:43,050 --> 00:07:44,050
[all yelling]

145
00:07:44,090 --> 00:07:45,800
[scoffs] You should've
walked away.

146
00:07:46,170 --> 00:07:47,550
[Xylo exclaims]

147
00:07:47,590 --> 00:07:49,090
-[troll growls]
-[XYLO] Dammit.

148
00:07:49,140 --> 00:07:50,760
Ahem.

149
00:07:51,430 --> 00:07:55,430
It would appear that you require
my divine blessing after all.

150
00:07:55,770 --> 00:07:58,560
Errant knight, you have
clearly reaped what was sown

151
00:07:58,600 --> 00:08:00,400
when you
cruelly abandoned me.

152
00:08:00,440 --> 00:08:01,770
Luckily...

153
00:08:01,860 --> 00:08:05,360
my benevolence is such
that I shall now save the day!

154
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:06,820
The time has come!

155
00:08:06,860 --> 00:08:08,490
March forth to glory!

156
00:08:08,530 --> 00:08:10,120
-Onward! With haste!
-Siena and Zofflec

157
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:12,280
are going to be
so furious with me.

158
00:08:12,330 --> 00:08:14,160
Wait, who are those weirdos?

159
00:08:14,200 --> 00:08:16,160
This is your last chance.

160
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:17,410
All of you should run

161
00:08:17,460 --> 00:08:19,790
or surrender now
while you still can.

162
00:08:20,290 --> 00:08:22,340
Otherwise, you're finished.

163
00:08:26,670 --> 00:08:27,840
[footsteps]

164
00:08:27,880 --> 00:08:29,680
[IRI] Brother, this way.

165
00:08:30,390 --> 00:08:33,050
[LIDEO] I won't let them
provoke me into rash action.

166
00:08:33,100 --> 00:08:36,480
We need to keep our heads low
and quietly leave the city.

167
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:40,940
Ruler of the United Kingdom
of Zef-Zeyal Meht Kioh,

168
00:08:40,980 --> 00:08:43,560
I am King Norgalle Senridge
the First.

169
00:08:43,610 --> 00:08:45,320
-Greetings, loyal subjects!
-[MAN 1] Can it!

170
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,650
[MAN 2] Who the hell are you?

171
00:08:46,780 --> 00:08:48,490
-[MAN 3] Shut up and die!
-[MAN 4] Come and face us!

172
00:08:48,530 --> 00:08:50,490
-[Norgalle grunts]
-[MAN 5] Drop dead!

173
00:08:51,110 --> 00:08:53,200
Seems diplomacy has failed,

174
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:55,120
and I despise
the remaining option.

175
00:08:55,160 --> 00:08:56,830
Pure vigilante justice.

176
00:08:57,750 --> 00:08:59,210
Yet, there's no choice.

177
00:08:59,250 --> 00:09:01,960
Men, for your crime of treason,

178
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:04,130
I sentence you to die!

179
00:09:04,170 --> 00:09:06,000
[screaming]

180
00:09:09,590 --> 00:09:11,300
Oh, shit! Stop him!

181
00:09:12,010 --> 00:09:13,010
[NORGALLE] Mmm.

182
00:09:13,090 --> 00:09:15,890
[Tatsuya yelling]

183
00:09:22,020 --> 00:09:23,440
[distant clamoring]

184
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:25,820
[Tatsuya yelling]

185
00:09:25,900 --> 00:09:27,400
-[horse neighs]
-[KNIGHT] Hyah!

186
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,780
[KNIGHT] Cut 'em down!

187
00:09:31,820 --> 00:09:33,320
Now the cavalry?

188
00:09:33,370 --> 00:09:34,490
Damn you all.

189
00:09:34,950 --> 00:09:36,330
Bastards!

190
00:09:36,620 --> 00:09:38,290
Heads up!

191
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,670
-[horse neighing]
-[KNIGHT 1] What the...

192
00:09:42,710 --> 00:09:45,000
-[KNIGHT 2] Dammit!
-[KNIGHT 3] Let's retreat!

193
00:09:46,880 --> 00:09:50,090
-Time to start the show. [yells]
-[knight screams]

194
00:09:54,470 --> 00:09:55,760
[slashing]

195
00:09:56,510 --> 00:09:57,640
[knight gasps]

196
00:10:02,690 --> 00:10:05,020
[sighs] They never
should've dragged

197
00:10:05,060 --> 00:10:06,900
you little beauties
into this mess.

198
00:10:06,940 --> 00:10:08,530
-Now off you go.
-[horse neighs]

199
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,400
[troll growls]

200
00:10:11,530 --> 00:10:12,530
[Xylo grunts]

201
00:10:12,610 --> 00:10:15,240
-[troll growls]
-[XYLO] Just my luck.

202
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:26,540
Hurry, Xylo!
We'll distract it for you!

203
00:10:28,710 --> 00:10:30,260
Now, Teoritta!

204
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:32,800
Ask and you shall receive!

205
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:34,130
I need you!

206
00:10:34,180 --> 00:10:36,050
-We're taking them down!
-[Teoritta chuckles]

207
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:37,970
[TEORITTA]
Has your heart awakened

208
00:10:38,010 --> 00:10:40,060
to the necessity
of my blessing, then?

209
00:10:40,100 --> 00:10:42,390
Guess so. I won't argue.

210
00:10:42,560 --> 00:10:44,270
[troll growling]

211
00:10:44,310 --> 00:10:45,900
Captain Kivia, follow me!

212
00:10:45,940 --> 00:10:47,230
Right! Run!

213
00:10:47,270 --> 00:10:50,280
[RAJIT]
Xylo Forbartz, don't fail us.

214
00:10:51,230 --> 00:10:52,400
[XYLO] Let's go.

215
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,740
[TEORITTA] At last!

216
00:10:53,780 --> 00:10:54,860
[troll growling]

217
00:10:54,900 --> 00:10:58,620
Hasten! Let us
end this battle at once!

218
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:02,870
[troll growling]

219
00:11:06,250 --> 00:11:07,830
[Xylo yelling]

220
00:11:15,670 --> 00:11:17,050
[both grunt]

221
00:11:18,350 --> 00:11:19,390
[Xylo grunts]

222
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:21,890
[XYLO] You saved us.
Thank you.

223
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:25,390
Uh, that is hardly sufficient.

224
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:28,560
It is a knight's sworn duty
to praise his goddess.

225
00:11:28,610 --> 00:11:29,650
[chuckles]

226
00:11:29,980 --> 00:11:31,650
[Xylo grunts softly]

227
00:11:31,690 --> 00:11:33,440
[TEORITTA]
Sweet words of adulation

228
00:11:33,490 --> 00:11:36,490
only have meaning
when they fall from your lips.

229
00:11:36,530 --> 00:11:40,740
Xylo, I so dearly wish
to hear you extol my greatness.

230
00:11:40,780 --> 00:11:41,950
[XYLO] Uh...

231
00:11:43,160 --> 00:11:44,790
-[Teoritta chuckles]
-[Xylo gasps]

232
00:11:44,830 --> 00:11:46,120
[chuckles] You win.

233
00:11:46,160 --> 00:11:48,960
I have to admit,
you are one hell of a goddess.

234
00:11:51,130 --> 00:11:52,420
[TEORITTA] Mm-hmm.

235
00:11:55,710 --> 00:11:59,010
[commander exclaims]

236
00:11:59,470 --> 00:12:00,850
[COMMANDER] I'll be damned.

237
00:12:00,890 --> 00:12:02,260
What's going on?

238
00:12:02,310 --> 00:12:03,970
[NORGALLE]
I trust you've had enough.

239
00:12:04,020 --> 00:12:06,980
Repent for your crimes against
the crown immediately,

240
00:12:07,020 --> 00:12:09,270
and I shall grant
each of you a pardon.

241
00:12:09,520 --> 00:12:11,310
[commander whimpers]

242
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:14,690
I don't know who you are,
but we surrender!

243
00:12:14,730 --> 00:12:16,240
[indistinct chatter]

244
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:23,200
How could this happen?

245
00:12:23,830 --> 00:12:27,160
The city my predecessor
entrusted to me.

246
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:31,290
Big Brother, stay together!

247
00:12:31,330 --> 00:12:32,590
Come on!

248
00:12:32,630 --> 00:12:33,670
Brother!

249
00:12:33,710 --> 00:12:34,800
Iri!

250
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:36,630
-[sword clangs]
-[DOTTA] Sorry 'bout this.

251
00:12:36,670 --> 00:12:37,970
[Lideo breathes shakily]

252
00:12:39,010 --> 00:12:42,430
[DOTTA] If it helps,
I'd much rather not be involved.

253
00:12:42,470 --> 00:12:45,600
Thing is, a big,
nasty guy threatened me.

254
00:12:45,640 --> 00:12:48,100
I tried my best
to wriggle out of it.

255
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:49,520
No!

256
00:12:49,640 --> 00:12:51,690
[DOTTA] I feel real bad
about doing this.

257
00:12:51,730 --> 00:12:52,940
But don't worry.

258
00:12:52,980 --> 00:12:54,900
Just come along quietly.

259
00:12:54,940 --> 00:12:56,940
I promise I won't hurt you.

260
00:12:57,490 --> 00:12:59,070
[Lideo breathes shakily]

261
00:13:13,830 --> 00:13:16,590
[BOOJUM] They've caused
quite a commotion.

262
00:13:16,630 --> 00:13:20,300
[SHIJI BAU] This night has
quickly spiraled out of control.

263
00:13:20,510 --> 00:13:22,800
Lideo Sodrick
may already be dead.

264
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:24,850
[WHALE]
Sounds like things got messy.

265
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:27,970
I dragged myself out here,

266
00:13:28,020 --> 00:13:30,390
and the client's already dead?

267
00:13:32,150 --> 00:13:34,270
I'm not running a charity.

268
00:13:34,310 --> 00:13:37,190
If there's no pay, I'm out.

269
00:13:37,230 --> 00:13:39,740
[Shiji Bau sighs]
I'll collect my reward,

270
00:13:39,780 --> 00:13:42,610
and leave town while the guild's
in a state of confusion.

271
00:13:42,660 --> 00:13:45,370
And what about you, Boojum?

272
00:13:45,410 --> 00:13:49,080
[BOOJUM] I'm going to go find
and rescue Lideo Sodrick.

273
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:51,500
Seems like
the polite thing to do.

274
00:13:51,540 --> 00:13:52,790
[SHIJI BAU] Seriously?

275
00:13:52,830 --> 00:13:55,460
[BOOJUM] I do owe the man
a debt of gratitude.

276
00:13:55,500 --> 00:13:57,840
I won't ask you
to help my cause...

277
00:13:57,880 --> 00:13:59,510
-[bee buzzing]
-Mm?

278
00:13:59,550 --> 00:14:01,510
Please excuse me a moment.

279
00:14:01,590 --> 00:14:03,510
[bee buzzing]

280
00:14:03,760 --> 00:14:05,010
Understood.

281
00:14:05,050 --> 00:14:06,720
That's the end of it.

282
00:14:07,430 --> 00:14:09,020
It's all over.

283
00:14:09,220 --> 00:14:10,390
[SHIJI BAU] What is it?

284
00:14:10,430 --> 00:14:11,930
[BOOJUM] New orders.

285
00:14:11,980 --> 00:14:15,850
I'm afraid Lideo Sodrick
will have to rescue himself.

286
00:14:16,150 --> 00:14:18,610
You're both here
to earn money, correct?

287
00:14:18,650 --> 00:14:22,030
How would you like
to embark on a new venture?

288
00:14:22,490 --> 00:14:25,820
-[SHIJI BAU] Explain.
-[Whale chuckles] Who's hiring?

289
00:14:25,860 --> 00:14:27,700
Why, that would be us.

290
00:14:28,660 --> 00:14:30,910
[low growling]

291
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:34,120
[growls]

292
00:14:34,210 --> 00:14:35,870
-[Shiji Bau gasps]
-[WHALE] Faeries.

293
00:14:35,920 --> 00:14:37,340
[monsters growling]

294
00:14:37,380 --> 00:14:38,840
[BOOJUM] Stop growling.

295
00:14:39,380 --> 00:14:40,880
How very rude of you.

296
00:14:41,380 --> 00:14:42,800
[squeals]

297
00:14:48,970 --> 00:14:50,310
I'm confused.

298
00:14:50,350 --> 00:14:51,310
Does that mean--

299
00:14:51,470 --> 00:14:53,100
[BOOJUM] I'll pay you
for your efforts.

300
00:14:53,140 --> 00:14:55,890
That's the only motivation
humans need

301
00:14:55,940 --> 00:14:58,570
to join our side, isn't it?

302
00:14:58,610 --> 00:15:00,690
[WHALE] I don't have
a problem with it.

303
00:15:00,730 --> 00:15:01,900
As long as I get paid,

304
00:15:01,980 --> 00:15:04,240
I'll work for adventurers,
the Demon Blight.

305
00:15:04,280 --> 00:15:05,780
Anyone, really.

306
00:15:05,820 --> 00:15:09,780
Now, go ahead and tell me
what the job is, boss.

307
00:15:09,830 --> 00:15:11,660
[BOOJUM] I'm not your boss,

308
00:15:11,700 --> 00:15:13,410
so don't call me that.

309
00:15:13,620 --> 00:15:16,120
Our orders are to erase
any evidence

310
00:15:16,170 --> 00:15:19,290
that could possibly link us
to Lideo Sodrick.

311
00:15:19,750 --> 00:15:22,840
Don't leave
a single trace behind.

312
00:15:23,300 --> 00:15:24,800
[WHALE] Not a problem.

313
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:26,800
That's one of my specialties.

314
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:29,100
[BOOJUM] I appreciate
your cooperation.

315
00:15:29,140 --> 00:15:32,470
Shiji Bau, have you decided?

316
00:15:32,520 --> 00:15:35,730
I owe you for everything
you've taught me.

317
00:15:35,770 --> 00:15:39,020
For that reason,
I would prefer not to kill you.

318
00:15:40,310 --> 00:15:42,150
[SHIJI BAU] In other words,

319
00:15:42,190 --> 00:15:44,740
you're asking me
to turn against humanity.

320
00:15:44,780 --> 00:15:46,780
[BOOJUM] I assume
that's not going to be

321
00:15:46,820 --> 00:15:48,280
an issue for you?

322
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:50,120
My time with Lideo Sodrick

323
00:15:50,160 --> 00:15:52,540
taught me an important lesson
about humans.

324
00:15:52,580 --> 00:15:55,330
There's nothing that matters
more to you creatures

325
00:15:55,370 --> 00:15:58,000
than protecting yourselves
and your families.

326
00:15:58,040 --> 00:16:01,500
Well, except, perhaps,
securing benefits

327
00:16:01,540 --> 00:16:03,630
and compensation
that feel proportionate

328
00:16:03,670 --> 00:16:05,090
to your sacrifice.

329
00:16:05,210 --> 00:16:09,220
Prioritizing personal gain above
saving your whole species.

330
00:16:09,260 --> 00:16:11,050
That's just human nature.

331
00:16:11,100 --> 00:16:13,010
Don't bother denying it.

332
00:16:15,890 --> 00:16:17,350
[SHIJI BAU] I won't.

333
00:16:17,390 --> 00:16:19,350
You're absolutely right.

334
00:16:19,940 --> 00:16:22,440
-[commander breathes uneasily]
-[Tatsuya growling]

335
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:24,150
[NORGALLE]
You're on guard duty.

336
00:16:24,190 --> 00:16:26,110
To atone for your treachery,

337
00:16:26,150 --> 00:16:28,360
I shall put you to work
for my people!

338
00:16:28,400 --> 00:16:31,280
Uh. Right! Get to work, crew!

339
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:32,410
[BRIGADE] Yes, sir!

340
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:34,370
[Lideo sighs]

341
00:16:35,700 --> 00:16:36,960
[FRENCI] Xylo,

342
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:39,500
my men and I will search
the second floor.

343
00:16:39,540 --> 00:16:42,250
If they left
physical evidence behind,

344
00:16:42,290 --> 00:16:43,540
we'll find it.

345
00:16:44,250 --> 00:16:46,420
Repent your lowly deeds!

346
00:16:46,460 --> 00:16:48,510
You must beg forgiveness
for all the suffering

347
00:16:48,550 --> 00:16:49,550
you have caused!

348
00:16:51,180 --> 00:16:53,890
Behold, Xylo, the luster
of my divine grace

349
00:16:53,930 --> 00:16:55,560
rendered this man
speechless!

350
00:16:55,600 --> 00:16:58,180
-[XYLO] Not sure that's it.
-It's as clear as day.

351
00:16:58,230 --> 00:17:00,650
Now speak!
Reveal everything you know!

352
00:17:00,690 --> 00:17:02,440
As leader of this guild,

353
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:05,190
I was the one who accepted
a generous job request

354
00:17:05,230 --> 00:17:06,610
to kill your whole group,

355
00:17:06,650 --> 00:17:09,360
but I don't know
anything about my employer.

356
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:11,780
Oh? That is quite unfortunate.

357
00:17:11,820 --> 00:17:13,780
Don't just take his word.

358
00:17:16,330 --> 00:17:18,200
Listen very carefully.

359
00:17:18,250 --> 00:17:20,830
You're in a precarious position
right now.

360
00:17:20,870 --> 00:17:22,920
Normally, I would just
hand you over

361
00:17:22,960 --> 00:17:24,540
to the Holy Knights.

362
00:17:24,590 --> 00:17:27,710
But I'm willing to be
persuaded otherwise.

363
00:17:27,760 --> 00:17:30,300
Hey! We're not here
to negotiate!

364
00:17:30,340 --> 00:17:33,050
You want me to stick
to threats of violence instead?

365
00:17:33,090 --> 00:17:35,600
Pretty sure that kind of thing
doesn't faze him.

366
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:37,100
[Lideo exhales]

367
00:17:37,770 --> 00:17:39,930
If you'll agree to my terms,

368
00:17:39,980 --> 00:17:41,690
I will negotiate with you.

369
00:17:42,980 --> 00:17:45,440
[XYLO] First,
tell me what you want.

370
00:17:45,690 --> 00:17:48,360
This is about my little brothers
and sisters.

371
00:17:48,400 --> 00:17:50,740
Promise me you'll spare them.

372
00:17:50,780 --> 00:17:53,950
What, you mean those creepy
little kids who kill for you?

373
00:17:53,990 --> 00:17:56,700
[LIDEO] If you can swear
that no harm will come to them,

374
00:17:56,740 --> 00:17:59,160
I would be willing
to trade for that.

375
00:17:59,200 --> 00:18:01,790
-[laughter]
-[indistinct chatter]

376
00:18:01,830 --> 00:18:03,460
[Xylo sighs]

377
00:18:03,500 --> 00:18:04,670
It's a deal.

378
00:18:04,710 --> 00:18:05,840
No, it's not!

379
00:18:05,880 --> 00:18:07,500
You don't have
that kind of authority!

380
00:18:07,550 --> 00:18:10,210
Well, would you rather
we hunt them down and kill them?

381
00:18:10,260 --> 00:18:12,340
Maybe one at a time
in front of him,

382
00:18:12,380 --> 00:18:14,130
real slow and painful.

383
00:18:14,180 --> 00:18:16,180
I wasn't suggesting that at all.

384
00:18:16,220 --> 00:18:17,850
Then you stay out of it.

385
00:18:17,890 --> 00:18:19,560
Anyway, listen.

386
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:21,430
The trade is simple enough.

387
00:18:21,480 --> 00:18:23,190
Tell us everything you know.

388
00:18:25,190 --> 00:18:28,400
The mission we were given
was to murder the goddess.

389
00:18:29,900 --> 00:18:31,320
Our employer

390
00:18:31,360 --> 00:18:33,530
-said he was a ""coexister."
-[Xylo gasps]

391
00:18:33,570 --> 00:18:36,160
There's that damn
annoying word again.

392
00:18:36,820 --> 00:18:38,410
[LIDEO]
Around ten days ago,

393
00:18:38,450 --> 00:18:42,200
I had my first meeting
with a man in an ornate mask.

394
00:18:43,250 --> 00:18:44,920
He made me an offer.

395
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:48,210
But in truth,
I didn't have much of a choice.

396
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:53,010
"Obey, coexist, or die."

397
00:18:54,720 --> 00:18:55,930
After that,

398
00:18:56,220 --> 00:18:59,220
I only had three check-ins
with some intermediaries.

399
00:18:59,720 --> 00:19:02,100
But they have eyes everywhere.

400
00:19:02,640 --> 00:19:03,980
If you want to stay alive,

401
00:19:04,020 --> 00:19:06,730
you have to prove yourself
useful to them.

402
00:19:07,400 --> 00:19:09,520
[XYLO] So you stabbed
humanity in the back

403
00:19:09,570 --> 00:19:10,980
to save your own skin,

404
00:19:11,030 --> 00:19:13,610
when a man like you
could've put up a fight.

405
00:19:13,650 --> 00:19:16,280
The coexisters plan
to yield full authority

406
00:19:16,320 --> 00:19:17,490
to the Demon Lords,

407
00:19:17,660 --> 00:19:20,410
and act as overseers
of the humans beneath them.

408
00:19:20,450 --> 00:19:23,080
A sick hierarchy of slaves,

409
00:19:23,120 --> 00:19:25,620
toiling away for their masters
and Demon Lords.

410
00:19:26,120 --> 00:19:28,460
They've spread
too much corruption.

411
00:19:28,500 --> 00:19:31,880
They've taken countless lives
and so many lands.

412
00:19:31,920 --> 00:19:34,470
Humanity
doesn't stand a chance.

413
00:19:34,510 --> 00:19:36,720
That's why it's crucial
that I toe the line,

414
00:19:36,760 --> 00:19:39,350
and secure a spot
as an overseer.

415
00:19:39,390 --> 00:19:42,350
I made that choice
to save my family.

416
00:19:43,470 --> 00:19:45,390
[XYLO] Keep your damn excuses
to yourself.

417
00:19:45,430 --> 00:19:47,770
I want more useful information,

418
00:19:47,810 --> 00:19:49,900
or otherwise, the deal is off.

419
00:19:51,770 --> 00:19:54,150
There's only
one other thing I know.

420
00:19:54,190 --> 00:19:56,990
The man in the mask
gave me his name.

421
00:19:57,240 --> 00:20:00,280
[XYLO] Tell me,
even if it's likely an alias.

422
00:20:00,320 --> 00:20:01,910
[Lideo breathes shakily]

423
00:20:01,950 --> 00:20:04,700
His name is Mahaeyzel Zelkoff.

424
00:20:04,750 --> 00:20:06,290
[KIVIA] That's preposterous.

425
00:20:06,330 --> 00:20:08,420
Mahaeyzel's the name of a saint.

426
00:20:08,460 --> 00:20:09,880
He was a leader of the Temple

427
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:13,340
during the First War
of Subjugation, ages ago.

428
00:20:13,380 --> 00:20:15,090
And while we're at it,

429
00:20:15,130 --> 00:20:17,260
the name "Zelkoff" is...

430
00:20:17,630 --> 00:20:18,840
[Kivia gasps]

431
00:20:19,680 --> 00:20:21,220
Wait a minute, are you...

432
00:20:23,510 --> 00:20:25,560
[grunts] My king! My king!

433
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:26,770
What's this?

434
00:20:26,810 --> 00:20:27,890
We're under fire?

435
00:20:27,940 --> 00:20:29,150
[Lideo exhales sharply]

436
00:20:32,020 --> 00:20:34,610
[WHALE] Not a bad way
to earn some coin.

437
00:20:34,650 --> 00:20:37,240
Don't put up too much
of a fight now.

438
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:42,410
[TEORITTA] The ceiling!

439
00:20:42,450 --> 00:20:43,740
We've gotta go!

440
00:20:44,540 --> 00:20:46,290
[DOTTA] This is bad!

441
00:20:46,950 --> 00:20:48,410
[JAYCE] They have artillery?

442
00:20:48,460 --> 00:20:49,540
[Dotta grunts]

443
00:20:52,750 --> 00:20:54,250
Xylo, get out of there!

444
00:20:54,290 --> 00:20:55,920
Kivia, get the hell out!

445
00:20:55,960 --> 00:20:57,510
Not yet! He's getting away!

446
00:20:58,670 --> 00:20:59,880
Come back!

447
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:02,680
Damn. [grunts]

448
00:21:02,720 --> 00:21:04,850
[XYLO] Run for it,
or you're dead!

449
00:21:09,560 --> 00:21:11,400
-[Kivia panting]
-[Xylo gasps]

450
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:13,060
Incoming! Get down!

451
00:21:18,320 --> 00:21:20,030
What are we up against?

452
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:22,070
Who attacks like that
inside of a city?

453
00:21:22,360 --> 00:21:23,820
Are they out of their minds?

454
00:21:23,870 --> 00:21:26,580
[XYLO] Dammit. If only we had
Neely with us.

455
00:21:26,620 --> 00:21:29,330
[JAYCE] Hey, don't you dare
blame this on Neely.

456
00:21:29,370 --> 00:21:30,370
I'll murder you.

457
00:21:30,410 --> 00:21:31,750
[XYLO] I didn't blame her.

458
00:21:31,790 --> 00:21:33,920
[NORGALLE]
If the enemy has artillery,

459
00:21:33,960 --> 00:21:36,710
our only option is
to seek out the aid of Rhyno.

460
00:21:36,750 --> 00:21:38,840
Which means
we must break our ally free

461
00:21:38,880 --> 00:21:40,380
from the cell
that's holding him.

462
00:21:40,420 --> 00:21:41,380
[DOTTA] Really?

463
00:21:41,550 --> 00:21:43,470
But that guy's impossible
to work with!

464
00:21:43,510 --> 00:21:46,300
Kivia, we're going
after Sodrick.

465
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:49,390
Right, of course.

466
00:21:49,430 --> 00:21:51,600
We won't let him slip away.

467
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:56,570
I have more questions for him.

468
00:21:56,610 --> 00:21:58,610
There's something
I have to know.

469
00:21:59,400 --> 00:22:01,780
Was he telling the truth?

470
00:22:01,820 --> 00:22:03,860
[Lideo pants]

471
00:22:03,910 --> 00:22:05,450
[footsteps]

472
00:22:07,740 --> 00:22:09,040
[IRI] Brother?

473
00:22:09,080 --> 00:22:10,330
[LIDEO] Huh?

474
00:22:10,960 --> 00:22:12,370
Iri?

475
00:22:12,410 --> 00:22:14,080
I'm so glad you're safe.

476
00:22:14,130 --> 00:22:15,540
Brother!

477
00:22:16,290 --> 00:22:17,340
It's over.

478
00:22:17,380 --> 00:22:19,590
I was so worried about you!

479
00:22:19,630 --> 00:22:20,840
[LIDEO] I'm fine.

480
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:23,130
I survived, just barely.

481
00:22:23,180 --> 00:22:24,760
Though the guild
was destroyed,

482
00:22:24,800 --> 00:22:26,600
at least we're alive.

483
00:22:26,760 --> 00:22:29,060
So where are the other children?

484
00:22:29,100 --> 00:22:30,640
[IRI] The ones
who evaded capture

485
00:22:30,680 --> 00:22:33,310
by the Holy Knights
aren't too far from here.

486
00:22:33,640 --> 00:22:35,190
I'm so grateful.

487
00:22:35,690 --> 00:22:38,230
I had to give in to their
demands to keep us safe,

488
00:22:38,270 --> 00:22:40,400
but it's nothing
for you to worry about.

489
00:22:40,690 --> 00:22:42,360
Elaborate.

490
00:22:44,660 --> 00:22:47,620
Brother, did you
tell them something?

491
00:22:47,660 --> 00:22:48,870
[LIDEO] No.

492
00:22:48,910 --> 00:22:50,700
Nothing important, anyway.

493
00:22:51,160 --> 00:22:52,750
[IRI] Is that so?

494
00:22:53,540 --> 00:22:55,370
-Iri. [grunts]
-[flesh squelching]

495
00:22:55,420 --> 00:22:58,710
[coughs, chokes]

496
00:23:01,710 --> 00:23:03,760
[IRI] Forgive me, big brother.

497
00:23:03,800 --> 00:23:05,510
I had no choice.

498
00:23:05,550 --> 00:23:07,890
[gurgling]

499
00:23:11,020 --> 00:23:12,390
Who are you?

500
00:23:12,430 --> 00:23:13,980
Where's Iri?

501
00:23:15,140 --> 00:23:16,350
Where?

502
00:23:16,390 --> 00:23:17,770
Iri is dead.

503
00:23:17,810 --> 00:23:20,570
I am simply borrowing
her mind and body.

504
00:23:20,610 --> 00:23:22,400
The other children
are over there.

505
00:23:26,820 --> 00:23:29,240
No, it can't be.

506
00:23:29,490 --> 00:23:31,330
My precious siblings.

507
00:23:31,370 --> 00:23:35,370
[cries] You killed my family!
Monster!

508
00:23:35,410 --> 00:23:37,080
[Lideo gags]

509
00:23:37,120 --> 00:23:40,130
This is goodbye,
my former brother.

510
00:23:40,170 --> 00:23:43,170
[Lideo wails]

511
00:23:44,300 --> 00:23:45,630
[Lideo screams]

512
00:23:55,270 --> 00:23:56,430
It appears his incompetence

513
00:23:56,480 --> 00:23:59,690
necessitates
speeding up the plan.

514
00:23:59,730 --> 00:24:02,230
Make preparations
to destroy the city.

515
00:24:02,280 --> 00:24:03,980
Kill all of the humans,

516
00:24:04,030 --> 00:24:05,610
and reduce
everything they've built

517
00:24:05,650 --> 00:24:06,950
to a pile of rubble.

518
00:24:06,990 --> 00:24:09,990
Most importantly,
find the goddess Teoritta,

519
00:24:10,030 --> 00:24:13,700
and then cut her down
by whatever means necessary.

520
00:24:13,740 --> 00:24:16,750
Before that,
may I request a bit of time?

521
00:24:16,790 --> 00:24:19,920
I would like to bury
Lideo Sodrick.

522
00:24:20,540 --> 00:24:22,800
[IRI] You needn't worry
about such things.

523
00:24:22,840 --> 00:24:24,300
Your one and only concern

524
00:24:24,340 --> 00:24:27,170
should be obeying any order
I dole out.

525
00:24:28,130 --> 00:24:29,970
I hope he'll forgive me.

526
00:24:30,010 --> 00:24:31,800
Despite my failure,

527
00:24:31,850 --> 00:24:34,970
I'll always be grateful to him
for buying me books.

528
00:24:35,020 --> 00:24:36,810
Each of you has a role to play,

529
00:24:36,850 --> 00:24:39,270
and I am not just referring
to Boojum.

530
00:24:39,310 --> 00:24:42,560
Of course, you will be
sufficiently rewarded,

531
00:24:42,610 --> 00:24:43,770
just as promised.

532
00:24:44,940 --> 00:24:46,190
Right.

533
00:24:46,240 --> 00:24:48,400
Before we get to the killing,

534
00:24:48,450 --> 00:24:51,410
mind telling us
what we should call you?

535
00:24:51,450 --> 00:24:52,910
[IRI (SPRIGGAN)] Spriggan.

536
00:24:54,290 --> 00:24:56,290
Since you asked nicely,

537
00:24:56,870 --> 00:24:59,370
you may call me "Spriggan."
